-- ===========================================================================
-- Warlock: Empowered Imp -> Sacrifice the Weak
-- ===========================================================================
--
-- TODO.md: "Sacrifice your demon to a new master in the Twisting Nether. In
--           return they grant you Nathrezim Foresight, reducing damage taken
--           and increasing the critical effect chance of your spells by 1%
--           for each Soul Shard in your possession."
--
-- Ranks: 47220 / 47221 / 47223 (talent 2045, Destruction).
--
-- Like Infernal Bargain this turns a passive into an ACTIVE ability:
--   - SPELL_ATTR0_PASSIVE (0x40) cleared: 464 -> 400.
--   - Effect1 becomes SPELL_EFFECT_DUMMY, handled by
--     spell_warl_sacrifice_the_weak (src/WarlockSacrificeTheWeak.cpp).
--   - RecoveryTime 180000 (3 min) -- you are giving away your demon.
--
-- Per-rank tuning lives in the rank spell's basepoints (DieSides = 0 so
-- CalcValue returns them unchanged):
--   EffectBasePoints1 = damage reduction % per Soul Shard (1 / 1 / 1)
--   EffectBasePoints2 = spell crit % per Soul Shard       (1 / 1 / 1)
-- The TODO specifies a flat 1% per shard, so the ranks currently differ only
-- in that higher ranks are cheaper to reach; the fields exist so the rates
-- can be split per rank later without touching C++.
--
-- The old Empowered Imp class masks MUST be zeroed: EffectSpellClassMaskA1
-- was 4096 (Firebolt) and EffectSpellClassMaskB2 was 16777216.  Left in
-- place they would silently restrict the redesigned effects.
-- The orphaned Empowered Imp proc buff (47283) is simply never cast again.
--
-- Spell 200403 "Nathrezim Foresight" is the permanent pact aura:
--   Effect1 = MOD_DAMAGE_PERCENT_TAKEN (MiscValue 127, all schools)
--   Effect2 = MOD_SPELL_CRIT_CHANCE
--   Effect3 = PERIODIC_DUMMY on a 1s amplitude -- the heartbeat that keeps
--             the two amounts in step with the live Soul Shard count.
-- DurationIndex 21 = permanent; the aura ends when a new demon is summoned.
-- All EffectSpellClassMasks are zeroed.
-- ===========================================================================


